"anytime.scanNoticeMessage" = "This app connects directly to an Anytime (Yuwell) transmitter of the CT2, CT4 or CT5 family and binds it to this phone. The CT2.5 and CT3 lines compute their glucose in a manufacturer's native library that this app does not have, so they are refused.\n\nBefore scanning, close the manufacturer's app and keep other Anytime transmitters out of range: a transmitter talks to one phone at a time and the first connection takes the first supported one it finds.\n\nScanning works only while this app is open. This driver has not been tried on a real sensor.";
