"mq.scanNoticeTitle" = "MQ / Glutec Sensor Connection";
"mq.scanNoticeMessage" = "This app connects directly to an MQ / Glutec transmitter over Bluetooth and does not use the manufacturer's online service. That service is what gives the official app the sensor's factory sensitivity, so here a value appears only after you enter that sensitivity or calibrate with a fingerstick.\n\nBefore scanning, close the manufacturer's app: a transmitter talks to one phone at a time, and the first connection takes the first MQ transmitter it finds.\n\nScanning works only while this app is open. This driver has not been tried on a real sensor.";
"mq.sectionTitle" = "Glutec CGM";
"mq.sectionFooter" = "Glucose is calculated in this app from the sensor current with the manufacturer's algorithm. A value needs a slope: either the factory sensitivity entered below (used from packet 19) or a fingerstick calibration with xDrip's calibration button (after packet 8). Until one of them exists the transmitter is followed but no value is shown. Accuracy has not been compared with a reference. Never tried on a real sensor.";
